    "displayName": "sm_logistics_gold",
    "description": "Star schema of a US trucking carrier, 2022 to 2024, built from a synthetic Kaggle dataset. Six business processes: loads, trips, pickup and delivery stops, fuel purchases, maintenance and safety incidents, sharing date, route, driver, truck, trailer and location dimensions. Answers on-time delivery by lane, contribution after fuel by route, asset economics, fuel spend, detention, maintenance spend, safety incidents, customer revenue and asset utilization."
